 class=\"text-center text-uppercase text-danger font-weight-bold mb-2 pt-4\">Important Notice - New Session Admission 2026</h5>\r\n                        <p class=\"pt-2\">\r\n                           IITTM will conduct an online test on <strong>20th August 2026 (Wednesday)</strong> from 04 pm onwards against the vacant seats. Please check your registered email regularly to get the exam link and login id credentials individually. Further online Group Discussion (G.D.) and Personal Interview (P.I.) date and time will be informed, which is compulsory for all to attend. Only the final result will be declared on the IITTM website www.iittm.ac.in<br>\r\n\r\n                           Students who missed the entrance test conducted before can also appear in this exam.<br>\r\n                           Note: Exam link and login ID credentials will be shared on the registered email ID.\r\n                        </p>                       \r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n<!-- library code -->\r\n\r\n<!-- <div class=\"modal fade\" id=\"myModal\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"exampleModalLabel\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n    <div class=\"modal-dialog modal-lg\" role=\"document\">\r\n        <div class=\"modal-content\">\r\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"close\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\">\r\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&times;</span>\r\n            </button>\r\n            <div class=\"modal-body\" style=\"border: 4px solid #002855;\">\r\n                <div class=\"popup_data p-0 py-md-4 pt-3\"> \r\n                    <div id=\"carouselExampleControls\" class=\"carousel slide\" data-ride=\"carousel\">\r\n                        <div class=\"carousel-inner\">\r\n                          <div class=\"carousel-item active\">\r\n                            <img src=\"images/NSD-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"img-fluid d-block\">\r\n